{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Ayal (איל).</b> Céruf in Old French." "<b>Tzvi (צבי).</b> Chevreuil in Old French." "<b>Veyachmor (והיחמור).</b> In Bibra, as we say in Bekhorot: 'these eggs of a wild ass (יחמורא).'" "<b>Ako (אקו).</b> Chamois." "<b>Dishon (דישן).</b> Chamois." "<b>Teho.</b> The teho is the to'o." "<b>Zamer.</b> Not interpreted."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {0 "Old French gloss transliterated as ציר״ף; exact modern identification uncertain.", 1 "Old French gloss transliterated as צברי״ל שולבי״א; exact modern identification uncertain.", 3 "Old French gloss אשטנבו״ק transliterated; identification uncertain.", 4 "Old French gloss שגל״א transliterated; exact modern identification uncertain, though appears to correspond to chamois or ibex."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:52:51.206058548Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}